            <note corresp="#d200-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d200-f1-content">
                <p>Source: National Archives, RG 59, S/P–NSC Files:
                    Lot 62 D 1, NSC Intelligence Directives. Secret.
                        DCID 4/3 and DCID 4/4 (<ref target="#d201">Document 201</ref>) were attached to
                    a single cover page, which indicated that both had been prepared by the Director
                    of Central Intelligence in collaboration with members of the Intelligence
                    Advisory Committee pursuant to National Security Council Intelligence Directive
                    No. 4, and that they were approved on December 14.</p>
